AL\n1\n-------«\nU T T E R *\nS C R IP T A\nM A N E T\n. ( u ____________J »\nREGSTE\nVOLUME 4\n\\  1934 ¿ jP\n' ^ A f l T E O ^ NUMBER 92\nWashington, Friday, May 12, 1939\nThe President\nEXECUTIVE ORDER\nE stablishing  th e A ppert  L ake  M igratory  \nW aterfow l  R efuge\nNORTH DAKOTA\nBy virtue of and pursuant to the au­\nthority vested In me as President of the \nUnited States, it is ordered that all lands \nowned or controlled by the United States \nwithin the following-described area, com­\nprising 1,162.76 acres, more or less, in \nEmmons County, North Dakota, be, and \nthey are hereby, reserved and set apart, \nsubject to valid rights, for the use of the \nDepartment of Agriculture as a refuge \nand breeding ground for migratory birds \nand other wildlife:\nFifth Principal Meridian\nT. 134 N., R. 76 W., \nsec. 2, lots 3 and 4, and S%NW%; \nsec. 3, all;\nsec. 4, lots 1, 2, 3, and 4, and S%N%.\nIt is unlawful for any person to pur­\nsue, hunt, trap, capture, wilfully disturb, \nor kill any bird or wild animal of a","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_8111.txt","sha256":"e5234abf5280ec6a873df391b67c6460236715fdf53839e074b9d2925f8636a0","source":{"line":61,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"42ce6a2e9cb2e28b4c8cf04dcd6eb79de5f0443d12fbe991b5afdf47ea4c74ab"}}]}
